              "Categories": {
                "value": "Krishnaraja Wadiyar III|PD-old-100-expired|PD-Art (PD-old-auto-expired)|CC-PD-Mark|1821 in Mysore|PD-Art missing SDC copyright status|PD-old missing SDC copyright status|Games in art of India|Board games in art|Sougandhika Parinaya",
