                "value": "<bdi><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Krishnaraja_Wodeyar_III\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Krishnaraja Wodeyar III\"><span title=\"Maharaja of Mysore (1794–1868)\">Mummadi Krishnaraja Wodeyar III</span></a></bdi>",
                "source": "commons-desc-page"
